{"id":"n1-167","title":"Verbる にも Verb れない","romaji":"Verb-ru ni mo Verb-re nai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses: 'Even if I try/want to do something, I cannot.'","longExplanation":"This pattern emphasizes that a person wants or attempts to do something (often in volitional form), but is incapable of doing so. It is often used with potential verbs in negative form: 'Even if I try to ~, I can't ~.'","formation":"Verb-volitional + にも + Verb-potential negative","examples":[{"jp":"彼を理解しようにも理解できない。","romaji":"Kare o rikai shiyou ni mo rikai dekinai.","en":"Even if I try to understand him, I can't.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"理解","vocabId":"1549910","reading":"りかい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"理解","vocabId":"1549910","reading":"りかい"},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]},{"jp":"走ろうにも走れない。","romaji":"Hashirou ni mo hashirenai.","en":"Even if I want to run, I can't.","words":[{"surface":"走ろう","vocabId":"1402540","reading":"はしろう","baseForm":"走る"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"走れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"走れる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]},{"jp":"泣こうにも泣けない。","romaji":"Nakou ni mo nakenai.","en":"Even if I want to cry, I can't.","words":[{"surface":"泣こう","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なこう","baseForm":"泣く"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣けない","vocabId":"1229850","reading":"なけない","baseForm":"泣ける"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]},{"jp":"忘れようにも忘れられない。","romaji":"Wasureyou ni mo wasurerarenai.","en":"Even if I try to forget, I just can’t.","words":[{"surface":"忘れよう","vocabId":"1519210","reading":"わすれよう","baseForm":"忘れる"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忘れられない","vocabId":"2791880","reading":"わすれられない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]}]}